{
  "caveats": [
    "These are nominal national retail prices for selected products, not a construction cost index, project quotation or district price survey. Product specifications and package sizes differ. The unit for sand is printed as “Cube” without a volume definition. Its 2025 price contains two decimal points and has no numeric value here. An extra final full stop in the 2025 boiled-lime price was removed after visual review; the original token and review note are retained.",
    "The source uses .. for unavailable figures and a dash for nil or negligible. Both retain their printed token and a distinct status; neither is converted to an exact zero."
  ],
